          "text": "Generalised anxiety symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Longstanding mild anxiety, usually manageable; increased over the past 4-6 weeks, especially at work in a noisy site with overtime. Patient says he is more on edge than usual; anxiety worsens when longer between cigarettes."
      }
    },
